from scripts.curate_remaining import Batch
b=Batch('07-disease-programs',['Cardiology','Infectious Diseases','Endocrinology','Nephrology','Neurology','Obstetrics and Gynecology','Oncology','Pediatrics','Psychiatry']);a=b.a;u=b.u
# Mechanism/delivery/assay links are conditional research routes, not treatment advice or efficacy claims.
a('PHA-09','CAR-01','A candidate regeneration trigger could be screened for a defined cardiac-cell response after injury.','It does not establish electrical coupling, replacement of scar, restored contractility or prevention of heart failure.','enabling')
a('BME-04','CAR-04','A qualified molecular scanner could provide an acquisition channel for the imaging branch of a plaque-assessment program.','It does not identify a predictive biomarker or establish years-ahead clinical accuracy.','enabling')
a('BME-06','CAR-05','A qualified assembly method could provide a fabrication route for a selected cardiac construct.','Perfusion, electrical coupling, load-bearing function and transplant readiness remain independent.','enabling')
a('BME-09','CAR-05','A qualified biomechanics model could compare geometric and mechanical constraints for a proposed construct.','A digital model does not grow a heart or validate physiological function.')
a('BME-07','CAR-09','Targeted editing delivery could be tested for a defined inherited cardiomyopathy variant.','Every variant, tissue distribution, long-term effect and safety requirement still needs qualification.','enabling')
a('PHA-03','CAR-10','A molecule-level toxicity hypothesis could help prioritize cardiac safety tests for selected cancer agents.','Prediction does not provide cardioprotection or establish preserved oncology efficacy for all treatments.')
a('MIC-06','INF-04','A resistance-evolution model could help design falsification tests of a candidate antibiotic’s no-bypass claim.','Forecasting resistance does not create an antibiotic or prove that resistance can never evolve.')
a('GEN-07','INF-07','A suppression model could help identify conditions under which a proposed vector intervention might be blocked or constrained.','It may limit rather than enable propagation; permanent elimination, controllability and ecological safety are not established.')
a('VIR-05','INF-08','A qualified causal pathway for a defined post-infection subgroup could motivate a preventive-intervention hypothesis.','Persistent infection is not assumed to explain every post-viral syndrome or to be safely preventable.','enabling')
a('MIC-01','INF-09','Qualified host cultures could provide controlled experiments for testing a candidate phage’s host range and effects.','Cultivation does not engineer a phage or establish universal specificity, efficacy or safety.','enabling')
a('BIO-07','END-01','A qualified growth-control mechanism could supply a candidate way to regulate the size/pattern of a beta-cell construct.','Growth does not establish beta-cell identity, physiological secretion or immune protection.','enabling')
a('IMM-09','END-01','A qualified antigen-specific tolerance method could address the immune-protection component of a proposed beta-cell intervention.','Tolerance does not regenerate cells or establish a permanent one-time cure.','enabling')
a('IMM-09','END-04','A qualified specificity mechanism could be investigated for a defined endocrine autoreactive response.','It does not identify every relevant antigen or restore already lost gland function.','enabling')
a('BME-07','END-06','A qualified editing/delivery method could be tested for a specified defect in an endogenous secretion program.','Delivery alone does not establish physiological pulsatility, lifelong secretion or treatment of every deficiency.','enabling')
a('BME-06','END-09','Assembly methods could provide a fabrication route for a selected endocrine tissue construct.','Vascularization, controlled hormone secretion and lifelong integration remain independent.','enabling')
a('BME-07','END-10','For an identified variant, an editing platform could deliver a candidate correction for evaluation.','No single defect across all CAH forms or safe restoration of hormone regulation is assumed.','enabling')
a('BIO-07','NEP-01','Tissue-growth control could provide candidate organization and termination constraints for a nephrogenesis design.','It does not identify the switch, establish filtration or create vascularized functioning nephrons.','enabling')
a('BME-08','NEP-02','Qualified implanted sensors could provide state feedback for a selected artificial-kidney design.','Feedback does not supply filtering, endocrine functions, external-power independence or host compatibility.','enabling')
a('BME-03','NEP-02','A qualified host-compatible material could provide an interface option for an implanted device.','Biocompatibility alone does not establish no anticoagulation, full kidney replacement or indefinite function.','enabling')
a('NEP-06','NEP-03','A qualified fibrosis-replacement intervention could address the fibrotic component explicitly named in the diabetic-kidney target.','It would not restore all podocytes, basement-membrane properties or function at every disease stage.','enabling')
a('IMM-09','NEP-04','A donor-specific application of a qualified tolerance mechanism could be tested in a kidney-transplant setting.','No permanent graft tolerance or absence of adverse immune effects is established.','enabling')
a('BME-07','NEP-07','An editing platform could be investigated for a defined cyst-associated variant or pathway.','Delivery is not cessation of cyst growth or restored renal architecture.','enabling')
a('BME-06','NEP-10','A qualified assembly method could provide a candidate renal-construct fabrication route.','Functional nephron organization, perfusion, immune compatibility and transplant timing remain unestablished.','enabling')
a('IMM-09','NRL-03','A qualified tolerance mechanism could be tested for the autoreactive component of a specified demyelinating condition.','Immune reset would not establish remyelination, restored axons or a one-time cure.','enabling')
a('LON-08','NRL-05','A qualified protein-homeostasis intervention could be screened for a defined tau-handling defect.','It does not establish the trauma-to-pathology mechanism, cognitive restoration or safe disease reversal.','enabling')
a('SUR-06','NRL-07','A qualified focused intervention could be tested for a specified pathological focus while protecting surrounding tissue.','Only an approach compatible with preserving healthy tissue fits; permanent cure and no cognitive effects are not established.','enabling')
a('LON-08','NRL-10','Proteostasis models could help test which defects are shared in selected degeneration models.','Shared protein-handling defects do not imply a single master regulator or reversal across all diseases.')
a('PHA-05','OBG-03','If a distinguishing ectopic-tissue state is identified, a state-specific activation mechanism could be screened as a local intervention route.','No selective marker, fertility preservation or permanent non-hormonal cure is established.','enabling')
a('PHA-09','OBG-06','A regeneration trigger could be screened in a defined uterine-wall repair model.','Scarless signaling alone does not establish normal strength, elasticity or safe future gestation.','enabling')
a('ONC-06','OBG-09','A qualified ovarian-detection component of a broader blood-test platform could provide one diagnostic route.','The broader test is not achieved, ovarian accuracy is not implied and detection does not supply prevention.','enabling')
a('BME-06','OBG-10','A qualified tissue-assembly process could provide a candidate fabrication route for uterine constructs.','Pregnancy support, vascular integration and all gestational functions are separate, unestablished requirements.','enabling')
a('ONC-03','ONC-01','An identified marker could be evaluated as a candidate antigen in a defined prevention experiment.','Marker presence does not establish cancer specificity, immunogenicity, prevention or coverage of every cancer.')
a('ONC-03','ONC-02','A qualified targeting handle could support a cell-directed intervention against a defined population.','No universal stem-cell marker or elimination of all metastatic cells is assumed.','enabling')
a('SUR-02','ONC-04','A qualified cellular/molecular image could supply an observation channel for a margin-classification system.','Imaging does not establish cancer-cell specificity or complete resection.','enabling')
a('BCH-06','ONC-05','A respiratory-coupling model could help define metabolic-state and energy-balance tests of the switching hypothesis.','The source’s tumor-starvation claim is not validated; metabolic switching may not be selective, safe or sufficient.')
a('BIF-01','ONC-06','A qualified integration method could combine candidate molecular blood measurements for testing a detection model.','It does not identify biomarkers or establish shedding, localization, specificity or clinical sensitivity.','enabling')
a('BIF-08','ONC-10','A regulatory-code model could help define candidate terminal-state patterns to test in a selected tumor model.','No safe reprogramming intervention or normalization across cancer types is established.','enabling')
a('BME-07','PED-07','A qualified delivery/editing system could be investigated for a specified newborn metabolic genotype.','Developmental dosing, organ access and lasting correction cannot be inferred from a general platform.','enabling')
a('IMM-09','PED-08','A qualified specificity mechanism could be tested in a defined pediatric autoreactive condition.','Developmental immune safety and durable remission need separate evidence.','enabling')
a('IMM-09','PED-10','A qualified donor-specific tolerance approach could be investigated in a specified pediatric transplant setting.','An antigen mechanism does not establish a master switch, lasting tolerance or pediatric safety.','enabling')
a('BIF-01','PSY-01','For a molecular-panel route, integration could supply candidate feature representations for diagnostic evaluation.','No biomarkers, biological categories or diagnostic accuracy across psychiatric conditions are established.','enabling')
a('PSY-06','PSY-01','A causal model could motivate diagnostic distinctions and measurements to test in independent cohorts.','An explanatory framework does not validate a biomarker test or every proposed disorder boundary.')
a('PSY-01','PSY-06','Qualified measurements could supply phenotyping observations for tests of competing causal models.','Measurement and association do not establish causation; this is empirical feedback, not circular validation.','feedback')
a('PHA-06','PSY-05','A qualified opioid/neuromodulator adaptation mechanism could provide a substance-specific component to test in a dependence-reset program.','Tolerance, dependence and addiction are not identical, and a limited mechanism does not establish a cure across substances.','enabling')
a('PSY-01','PSY-09','A qualified assay could supply measurements for a prospective transition-risk study.','Current-state diagnosis does not establish future prediction, effective prevention or the stated success rate.','enabling')
